插线后自动切换 USB 连接模式为 MTP，无需手动点选, coloros系统设备可使用去除系统弹窗的模块达到彻底无弹窗的效果
After plugging in, it automatically switches the USB connection mode to MTP without needing manual selection. Devices with the ColorOS system can use other modules that remove system pop-ups to achieve a completely popup-free experience.
